### 1. Show all (GET All items)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json

### 2. Read one (GET one item)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items/1
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json

### 3. Create one (POST)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "New Item",
  "description": "This is a newly created item",
  "price": 99.99
}

### 4. Update one (PUT)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items/1
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Item",
  "description": "This item has been updated",
  "price": 149.99
}

### 5. Delete one (DELETE)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items/1
Authorization: Basic admin admin